const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"重采样要估计的是统计量的分布",en:"The target is a statistic's sampling distribution"},body:{zh:"Efron提出的问题是：只观察到一个样本，如何近似某个统计量在重复抽样下的分布？研究对象可以是偏差、方差或更一般的统计量，而不只是样本均值。先明确要估计什么分布，才能判断重采样结果是否回答了原本的问题。",en:"Efron asks how one observed sample can approximate a statistic's distribution under repeated sampling. The target may concern bias, variance or a more general quantity rather than only a sample mean. Defining that target first determines whether a resampling result answers the intended question."},reference:{url:"https://sites.stat.washington.edu/courses/stat527/s13/readings/ann_stat1979.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1979年期刊版，第1–2页",en:"Source: 1979 journal article, pp. 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"用经验分布近似未知分布",en:"Replace the unknown distribution with an empirical one"},body:{zh:"基本构造把每个已观察值赋予1/n的概率质量，形成经验分布，再把未知总体分布替换为它。这是从样本出发的近似，并没有创造新的总体信息。原样本若遗漏某类对象，重复抽取现有观测也不会自动恢复那些没有出现的对象。",en:"The basic construction assigns probability mass 1/n to each observed value and substitutes that empirical distribution for the unknown population. This is an approximation based on available data, not new population information. Resampling cannot automatically restore groups absent from the original observations."},reference:{url:"https://sites.stat.washington.edu/courses/stat527/s13/readings/ann_stat1979.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1979年期刊版，第3页",en:"Source: 1979 journal article, pp. 3"}}},{title:{zh:"有放回抽取与打乱顺序不同",en:"Sampling with replacement is not permutation"},body:{zh:"每次从经验分布中有放回抽取n个观测，因此某些原始值可能重复出现，另一些则不出现。它不是简单打乱原样本的顺序。置换检验与这种自助法具有不同随机机制，不能因为都生成很多样本，就把它们的假设与解释混为一谈。",en:"Each bootstrap sample draws n observations with replacement, so some original values repeat and others are absent. This is not merely a permutation of the data. Permutation tests and this bootstrap construction use different random mechanisms, even though both can generate many simulated samples."},reference:{url:"https://sites.stat.washington.edu/courses/stat527/s13/readings/ann_stat1979.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1979年期刊版，第3页",en:"Source: 1979 journal article, pp. 3"}}},{title:{zh:"每次重新计算同一个目标",en:"Recompute a consistently defined target"},body:{zh:"在每个重采样数据上重新计算目标统计量，同时使用经验分布对应的参照量，便形成自助分布。目标如何中心化或标准化会影响近似表现。只汇总重采样后的原始数据分布，而没有重新计算所关心的估计量，通常不是同一个任务。",en:"The target is recalculated on each resample using the corresponding empirical-distribution reference, producing a bootstrap distribution. Centering and scaling can affect approximation quality. Summarizing the resampled raw observations without recomputing the estimator of interest generally answers a different question."},reference:{url:"https://sites.stat.washington.edu/courses/stat527/s13/readings/ann_stat1979.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1979年期刊版，第2–3页",en:"Source: 1979 journal article, pp. 2–3"}}},{title:{zh:"刀切法是相关方法，不是同一个过程",en:"The jackknife is related but not identical"},body:{zh:"普通刀切法通过逐个删去观测重新估计，自助法则从经验分布有放回抽样。论文用线性近似理解二者的联系，并以样本中位数等例子说明适用表现可能不同。不能据此宣称任何统计量都能可靠地刀切，或自助法对所有问题都优于其他方法。",en:"The ordinary jackknife recomputes estimates after leaving out individual observations, whereas the bootstrap resamples with replacement. The paper relates them through linear approximation and discusses differing behavior for statistics such as the median. Neither connection establishes universal reliability or superiority for every statistic."},reference:{url:"https://sites.stat.washington.edu/courses/stat527/s13/readings/ann_stat1979.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1979年期刊版，第1–3页",en:"Source: 1979 journal article, pp. 1–3"}}},{title:{zh:"抽样单位决定保留什么依赖",en:"The sampling unit determines retained dependence"},body:{zh:"原始单样本说明从同一未知分布抽取观测。若把有时间相关的日收益或同一公司多期资料当作独立行抽取，就改变了原有依赖。应用到金融面板前，需要另行说明适合该结构的抽样单位与方法；重复次数更多并不能代替这个设计判断。",en:"The introductory one-sample construction draws observations from one unknown distribution. Treating dependent daily returns or repeated firm records as independent rows changes their dependence. Financial panels need a separately justified sampling unit and method; increasing repetitions cannot substitute for that design decision."},reference:{url:"https://sites.stat.washington.edu/courses/stat527/s13/readings/ann_stat1979.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1979年期刊版，第2–3页",en:"Source: 1979 journal article, pp. 2–3"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"这里介绍原始单样本构造，不是对所有数据结构的自助法保证。有放回抽样不能自动保留时间、公司或群组依赖；增加重复次数也不会修复样本偏差。",en:"This guide describes the original one-sample construction, not universal bootstrap validity. Sampling with replacement does not automatically preserve time, firm or cluster dependence; more repetitions do not repair sample bias."}};export{e as default};
